(0.96&#x02013;1.35)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">S&#x0002b;C</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">1.01</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="&#x02013;" charoff="50">(0.78&#x02013;1.30)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">1.02</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="&#x02013;" charoff="50">(0.79&#x02013;1.32)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">1.03</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="&#x02013;" charoff="50">(0.80&#x02013;1.32)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">S&#x0002b;H</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">1.05</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="&#x02013;" charoff="50">(0.94&#x02013;1.17)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.80</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="&#x02013;" charoff="50">(0.70&#x02013;0.90)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.79</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="&#x02013;" charoff="50">(0.70&#x02013;0.89)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">S</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.80</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="&#x02013;" charoff="50">(0.69&#x02013;0.92)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.77</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="&#x02013;" charoff="50">(0.67&#x02013;0.90)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.78</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="&#x02013;" charoff="50">(0.67&#x02013;0.90)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">R&#x0002b;C&#x0002b;H</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">6.07</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="&#x02013;" charoff="50">(4.50&#x02013;8.19)</td><td align="char" valign="t