query: 'Br J Cancer||71|1275||bib20|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7779723</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib21"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sainsbury</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Haward</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Rider</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Johnston</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Round</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Influence on clinician workload and patterns of treatment on survival from breast cancer</article-title><source>Lancet</source><year>1995a</year><volume>345</volume><fpage>1265</fpage><lpage>1270</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Lancet||345|1265||bib21|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7746056</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib22"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>Yorkshire Cancer Organisation (YCO)</collab></person-group><article-title/><year>1995</year><fpage>22</fpage>Cancer in Yorkshire: Cancer Registry Special Report Series: Breast Cancer, p</citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>